{
  "141.csv::91": {
    "id": "141.csv::91",
    "source_text": "時はきた――だな\n心して行くがよい",
    "translated_text": "&#x27;Tis time—aye.\nGo forth with resolve.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T18:58:37.626198",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T18:58:37.627262",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 91,
    "speaker": "Joseph",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::92": {
    "id": "141.csv::92",
    "source_text": "竜と人が交わした親愛の情――\nフィンダムの命が長い歴史の中で\n結びあった絆――",
    "translated_text": "The deep affection exchanged &#x27;twixt dragon and human—\nThe bond Phindym&#x27;s life hath woven through the long history—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T18:58:50.231298",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T18:58:50.232566",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 92,
    "speaker": "The White Dragon",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::93": {
    "id": "141.csv::93",
    "source_text": "それら全てを忘れた竜の強さは\nおまえたちの想像を上回るだろう",
    "translated_text": "The strength of the dragon that hath forgotten all those things... shall surpass your imagination.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T18:59:11.069212",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T18:59:11.070519",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 93,
    "speaker": "The White Dragon",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::94": {
    "id": "141.csv::94",
    "source_text": "思いが挫けては倒せぬ\n心身の備えを万全にして挑むがよい",
    "translated_text": "Should thy resolve falter, thou canst not prevail.\nMake ready both mind and body, then face what comes.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T18:59:19.051664",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T18:59:19.053114",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 94,
    "speaker": "The White Dragon",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::95": {
    "id": "141.csv::95",
    "source_text": "竜を倒して竜を守る覚者――",
    "translated_text": "An Arisen who slays the dragon to protect the dragon—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T18:59:29.503270",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T18:59:29.504678",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 95,
    "speaker": "Klaus",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::96": {
    "id": "141.csv::96",
    "source_text": "長い歴史でも、君たちが最初だろうね\nうん、すごいことだと思うな",
    "translated_text": "Even in the long history, you&#x27;re probably the first.\nYeah, &#x27;tis a remarkable thing, I think.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T18:59:58.387094",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T18:59:58.389579",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 96,
    "speaker": "Klaus",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::97": {
    "id": "141.csv::97",
    "source_text": "いよいよ最後の戦いに挑む――\nと言ったところかな？",
    "translated_text": "At last, we face the final battle... or so one might say?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:00:16.371500",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:00:16.373895",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 97,
    "speaker": "Gerd",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::98": {
    "id": "141.csv::98",
    "source_text": "こちら側のことは我々に任せて\n存分に戦ってくれ",
    "translated_text": "Leave this to us. Fight without reserve.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:00:33.601046",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:00:33.603374",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 98,
    "speaker": "Gerd",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::99": {
    "id": "141.csv::99",
    "source_text": "我らの心は決まっている\nもう嘆きはしない",
    "translated_text": "Our hearts are decided. We shall lament no more.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:01:00.469526",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:01:00.471806",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 99,
    "speaker": "Gearóid",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::100": {
    "id": "141.csv::100",
    "source_text": "隊長――",
    "translated_text": "Captain—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:01:09.192550",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:01:09.195197",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 100,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::101": {
    "id": "141.csv::101",
    "source_text": "隊長、あと少しですね\nがんばりましょう！",
    "translated_text": "Captain, just a little more.\nLet&#x27;s do our best!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:01:17.238162",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:01:17.241361",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 101,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::102": {
    "id": "141.csv::102",
    "source_text": "話し足りねえのか？\nもう、行くしかねえぞ",
    "translated_text": "Not done talkin&#x27; yet?\nRight, no choice but to go.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:01:34.616681",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:01:34.619135",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 102,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::103": {
    "id": "141.csv::103",
    "source_text": "もう、決心した――覚悟した\nだから、出発！",
    "translated_text": "Right, I&#x27;ve made up my mind—steeled myself. So we&#x27;re off!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:01:52.941527",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:01:52.944792",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 103,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::104": {
    "id": "141.csv::104",
    "source_text": "ここまで来て怖じ気づくとか\n尻込みするとか、あり得ませんから――\nええ、あり得ませんとも！",
    "translated_text": "After coming this far, getting cold feet or shrinking back—impossible. Yes, absolutely impossible!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:02:23.036815",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:02:23.040128",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 104,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::105": {
    "id": "141.csv::105",
    "source_text": "竜よ――ウィルミアよ――",
    "translated_text": "Dragon... Willmia...",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:02:34.151124",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:02:34.153777",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 105,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::106": {
    "id": "141.csv::106",
    "source_text": "わたしはこの試練を乗り越える！",
    "translated_text": "I shall overcome this trial!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:02:40.998066",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:02:41.000768",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 106,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::107": {
    "id": "141.csv::107",
    "source_text": "眠って――静かに眠りについて――",
    "translated_text": "Sleep... and fall into quiet slumber...",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:02:53.429557",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:02:53.432249",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 107,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::108": {
    "id": "141.csv::108",
    "source_text": "精霊竜よ、鎮まりたまえ！",
    "translated_text": "Spirit Dragon, be still!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:03:15.708239",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:03:15.711237",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 108,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::109": {
    "id": "141.csv::109",
    "source_text": "ためらいは命取りです！",
    "translated_text": "&#x27;Tis fatal to hesitate!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:03:38.481158",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:03:38.484370",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 109,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::110": {
    "id": "141.csv::110",
    "source_text": "ウィルミア、こっちを見て！",
    "translated_text": "Willmia, look here!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:03:50.573593",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:03:50.576599",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 110,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::111": {
    "id": "141.csv::111",
    "source_text": "これでどう！？",
    "translated_text": "How&#x27;s this?!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:03:58.851032",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:03:58.854510",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 111,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::112": {
    "id": "141.csv::112",
    "source_text": "せいやっ！",
    "translated_text": "Hah!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:04:10.972792",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:04:10.975867",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 112,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::113": {
    "id": "141.csv::113",
    "source_text": "波状攻撃でいきましょう！",
    "translated_text": "Let&#x27;s attack in waves!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:04:19.949356",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:04:19.952071",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 113,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::114": {
    "id": "141.csv::114",
    "source_text": "みなさん――頑張って",
    "translated_text": "Everyone—pray, do your best.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:04:36.192726",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:04:36.195809",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 114,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::115": {
    "id": "141.csv::115",
    "source_text": "――わたしには使命がある",
    "translated_text": "...I have a mission.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:05:21.500762",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:05:21.504817",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 115,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::116": {
    "id": "141.csv::116",
    "source_text": "ウィルミア――あとはわたしが！",
    "translated_text": "Willmia — I&#x27;ll handle the rest!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:05:33.811568",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:05:33.814955",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 116,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::117": {
    "id": "141.csv::117",
    "source_text": "遠慮はしねえぞ！",
    "translated_text": "Ain&#x27;t holdin&#x27; back!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:05:46.988878",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:05:46.992072",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 117,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::118": {
    "id": "141.csv::118",
    "source_text": "おい、手加減は無礼だぞ？",
    "translated_text": "Hoy, holdin&#x27; back&#x27;s rude, eh?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:06:01.076157",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:06:01.079436",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 118,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::119": {
    "id": "141.csv::119",
    "source_text": "リズ、腰が引けてる！",
    "translated_text": "Lise, you&#x27;re cowering!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:06:22.295933",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:06:22.299252",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 119,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::120": {
    "id": "141.csv::120",
    "source_text": "隊長、相変わらずキレがいいな",
    "translated_text": "Captain, still sharp as ever, eh.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:07:02.611452",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:07:02.614871",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 120,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::121": {
    "id": "141.csv::121",
    "source_text": "エリオット、もっと動け！",
    "translated_text": "Elliot, move faster!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:07:14.023968",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:07:14.028020",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 121,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::122": {
    "id": "141.csv::122",
    "source_text": "どんな状況でも竜は竜――手強いぜ",
    "translated_text": "A dragon&#x27;s a dragon, no matter the situation — tough bastard, eh.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:07:40.184732",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:07:40.188479",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 122,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::123": {
    "id": "141.csv::123",
    "source_text": "高く舞って攻撃！　これはどう！？",
    "translated_text": "Soaring high, I strike! How&#x27;s this!?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:07:56.999760",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:07:57.003640",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 123,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::124": {
    "id": "141.csv::124",
    "source_text": "低く駆けて攻撃！　いい感じ？",
    "translated_text": "Low dash attack! How&#x27;s that?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:08:13.486024",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:08:13.489853",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 124,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::125": {
    "id": "141.csv::125",
    "source_text": "素早く回って攻撃！　速っ！　我ながら速っ！",
    "translated_text": "Circle round quick and strike! Fast! Fast even for me!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:08:22.373961",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:08:22.378090",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 125,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::126": {
    "id": "141.csv::126",
    "source_text": "疲れたかも！　これ、まずいかも！",
    "translated_text": "Mayhap I&#x27;m tired! This could be bad!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:08:45.465544",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:08:45.469946",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 126,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::127": {
    "id": "141.csv::127",
    "source_text": "ここまで来たんだもの！　最後まで見届ける！",
    "translated_text": "We&#x27;ve come this far! I&#x27;ll see it through to the end!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:08:58.775816",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:08:58.780670",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 127,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::128": {
    "id": "141.csv::128",
    "source_text": "生き残るぞ～！　わたしは生き延びるぞ～！",
    "translated_text": "I&#x27;ll survive! I&#x27;ll make it through!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:09:20.815246",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:09:20.819424",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 128,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::129": {
    "id": "141.csv::129",
    "source_text": "精霊竜よ、許したまえ！",
    "translated_text": "Spirit Dragon, forgive me!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:09:26.266758",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:09:26.270713",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 129,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::130": {
    "id": "141.csv::130",
    "source_text": "病んでも竜――やっぱり凄いですね",
    "translated_text": "Even sick, a dragon—&#x27;tis formidable still.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:10:22.985845",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:10:22.989908",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 130,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::131": {
    "id": "141.csv::131",
    "source_text": "逃げませんよ、ええ、おれ、逃げません！",
    "translated_text": "I won&#x27;t run, yeah, I won&#x27;t run!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:10:38.400049",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:10:38.404211",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 131,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::132": {
    "id": "141.csv::132",
    "source_text": "隊長、一気に決めましょう！",
    "translated_text": "Captain, let&#x27;s finish this at once!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:10:54.116109",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:10:54.120219",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 132,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::133": {
    "id": "141.csv::133",
    "source_text": "はぁ――はぁ――キツいなあ",
    "translated_text": "Haah—haah— This is rough.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:11:09.273748",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:11:09.278174",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 133,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::134": {
    "id": "141.csv::134",
    "source_text": "もう――ジョゼフ様だって褒めてくれるはず――",
    "translated_text": "Come on— even Master Joseph&#x27;ll praise me—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:11:21.392994",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:11:21.397107",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 134,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::135": {
    "id": "141.csv::135",
    "source_text": "行っちまったなあ――\n若い娘ってのは、まったくよ――",
    "translated_text": "She&#x27;s up and gone—\nYoung lasses, the lot of &#x27;em—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:11:37.049668",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:11:37.052215",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 135,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::136": {
    "id": "141.csv::136",
    "source_text": "セシリーは覚者なんだから――\nわかっていた――\nこうなるって知ってたけど――",
    "translated_text": "Cecily&#x27;s an Arisen, so—\nI knew—\nKnew it&#x27;d come to this, but—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:11:47.553062",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:11:47.555776",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 136,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::137": {
    "id": "141.csv::137",
    "source_text": "なんでだろう――泣けちゃう",
    "translated_text": "I wonder why... I find myself crying.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:12:31.658940",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:12:31.663886",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 137,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::138": {
    "id": "141.csv::138",
    "source_text": "これはお別れじゃありませんよ？\nセシリーが竜になる\n理どおりです\n問題なんかありません",
    "translated_text": "This isn&#x27;t farewell, is it?\nCecily&#x27;s becoming a dragon\n&#x27;Tis the Order&#x27;s way\nThere&#x27;s no problem at all",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:12:46.911955",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:12:46.916437",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 138,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::139": {
    "id": "141.csv::139",
    "source_text": "いや――しいて言えば――\n俺のこの胸が張り裂けそうなのは\nかなり問題です――隊長――俺、つらいです",
    "translated_text": "Nay— if pressed— &#x27;tis a proper problem, my chest fit to burst— Captain— I&#x27;m sufferin&#x27;",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:13:21.559139",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:13:21.563856",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 139,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::140": {
    "id": "141.csv::140",
    "source_text": "たとえ姿が変わっても、あれはわたしの娘だと\n思うことは許されるのだろうか？",
    "translated_text": "Even if her form has changed, may I still think of her as my daughter?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:13:36.157884",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:13:36.162626",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 140,
    "speaker": "Gearóid",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::141": {
    "id": "141.csv::141",
    "source_text": "いや、ダメだと言われても\n心の中ばかりはどうしようもないがな",
    "translated_text": "Nay, even if told &#x27;no&#x27;, there&#x27;s naught to be done for what lies in my heart.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:14:02.742041",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:14:02.746841",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 141,
    "speaker": "Gearóid",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::142": {
    "id": "141.csv::142",
    "source_text": "ガラダを見よ――\nなんと立派な族長――そして父親",
    "translated_text": "Behold Gearóid — how magnificent a chief — and father",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:14:20.720471",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:14:20.724544",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 142,
    "speaker": "Mordred",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::143": {
    "id": "141.csv::143",
    "source_text": "あの親子がいてくれなかったら\nフィンダムは朽ち果てていただろうよ",
    "translated_text": "Had that parent and child not been there, Phindym would have fallen to ruin.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:14:37.724795",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:14:37.727720",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 143,
    "speaker": "Mordred",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::144": {
    "id": "141.csv::144",
    "source_text": "フィンダムに娘を捧げた父親に\nかける言葉はけして惜しむまい",
    "translated_text": "I shall not spare words for the father who sacrificed his daughter to Phindym.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:14:51.862777",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:14:51.865790",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 144,
    "speaker": "Doherty",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::145": {
    "id": "141.csv::145",
    "source_text": "あなたたちへの感謝を、わたしたちは\n生涯忘れないでしょう",
    "translated_text": "We shall not forget our gratitude to you all our days.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:15:13.651082",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:15:13.654067",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 145,
    "speaker": "Maia",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::146": {
    "id": "141.csv::146",
    "source_text": "覚者の顔を知っている竜の守番は\n初めてだな――",
    "translated_text": "For a dragon&#x27;s guard to know the Arisen&#x27;s face... &#x27;tis a first—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:15:33.849911",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:15:33.852451",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 146,
    "speaker": "Tadhg",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::147": {
    "id": "141.csv::147",
    "source_text": "つい、必要以上に世話を焼いてしまいそうだ",
    "translated_text": "I fear I may unwittingly fuss over you more than is needful.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:15:48.149666",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:15:48.152358",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 147,
    "speaker": "Tadhg",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::148": {
    "id": "141.csv::148",
    "source_text": "セシリーは、どうなの？　元気にしている？",
    "translated_text": "How fares Cecily? Is she well?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:16:08.838180",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:16:08.840649",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 148,
    "speaker": "Pamela",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::149": {
    "id": "141.csv::149",
    "source_text": "ひさしぶりにセシリーに会いたいな\n今度、一緒にここに来てね！",
    "translated_text": "I&#x27;ve been longing to see Cecily again. Do come here with me next time!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:16:50.534124",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:16:50.536919",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 149,
    "speaker": "Mayleaf",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::150": {
    "id": "141.csv::150",
    "source_text": "レスタニアに入り込んだ侵食魔は\nほとんど退治したぞ",
    "translated_text": "We&#x27;ve all but exterminated the Corruption Demons that infiltrated Lestania.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:17:03.507493",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:17:03.511892",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 150,
    "speaker": "Gerd",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::151": {
    "id": "141.csv::151",
    "source_text": "まだ完全とはいかないが、時間の問題だろうよ",
    "translated_text": "&#x27;Tis not yet complete, but &#x27;tis a matter of time.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:17:21.684010",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:17:21.688174",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 151,
    "speaker": "Gerd",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::152": {
    "id": "141.csv::152",
    "source_text": "精霊竜を倒したんだよね？\nということは、セシリーは――",
    "translated_text": "You&#x27;ve defeated the Spirit Dragon, haven&#x27;t you? Then that means Cecily is—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:17:35.648832",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:17:35.651792",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 152,
    "speaker": "Klaus",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::153": {
    "id": "141.csv::153",
    "source_text": "ごめん――\n聞くまでも――ないよね",
    "translated_text": "Sorry... didn&#x27;t even need to ask, did I?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:17:53.735642",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:17:53.739149",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 153,
    "speaker": "Klaus",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::154": {
    "id": "141.csv::154",
    "source_text": "覚者であることを忘れた娘――\n危うい存在ではあったが\n理の中に戻ったようだな",
    "translated_text": "A daughter who forgot she was Arisen— a perilous existence she was, yet she doth seem returned within the Order.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:18:28.557849",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:18:28.561605",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 154,
    "speaker": "The White Dragon",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::155": {
    "id": "141.csv::155",
    "source_text": "我が覚者よ、無事の帰還を祝そう\n今はただ、休むがいい",
    "translated_text": "My Arisen, I shall celebrate thy safe return. Now, simply rest.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:18:43.834078",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:18:43.837579",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 155,
    "speaker": "The White Dragon",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::156": {
    "id": "141.csv::156",
    "source_text": "そうか、ついにやったか！\nこれにて一件落着というわけだな！",
    "translated_text": "So you&#x27;ve finally done it! That settles the matter, then!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:19:25.669897",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:19:25.673288",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 156,
    "speaker": "Joseph",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "141.csv::157": {
    "id": "141.csv::157",
    "source_text": "――おや、どうした\nなぜ沈んでいる――\n――つらいことがあったのか？",
    "translated_text": "Hm. What ails you.\nWhy so downcast—\nDid something painful happen?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-18T19:19:59.984673",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T19:19:59.991151",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\141.csv",
    "row_index": 157,
    "speaker": "Joseph",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  }
}